    {"id":"VIS-001","severity":"release-blocking","title":"Reference-faithful geometry remains unproven","finding":"The fleet has varied primitives but still reads as a repeated simplified slab-hull/superstructure vocabulary; all 20 draft distinctive-features checks fail.","requiredAction":"Refine hulls, glazing, rooflines, decks and model-specific features against each reference dossier, then re-review canonical views."},
